<LegalPage title="Contact Us" description="How to reach the DealsSite team for corrections, brand requests and general questions.">
  <p>We read every message. Email us at <a href="mailto:contact@dealssite.com">contact@dealssite.com</a>.</p>

  <h2>What to write to us about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Expired or incorrect offers:</strong> send the page link and what you saw on the brand's site.</li>
    <li><strong>Brand listings:</strong> if you represent a brand and want an offer listed or updated, include the official offer page.</li>
    <li><strong>Privacy requests:</strong> mention the request type in the subject line.</li>
    <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> include your website and the placement you are interested in.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Response time</h2>
  <p>We aim to reply within a few business days.</p>
</LegalPage>
